  <description>
    LYBUNT: gave last fiscal year, has not given this fiscal year. A donor is on this list when
    their most recent gift of more than zero, in status Received, Refunded or Written off, falls
    in the last fiscal year. A gift refunded afterwards still counts as a gift, and a refund
    itself never counts as one, because it is a negative amount.
  </description>
